2. “NO TRAINING RIGHTS GRANTED” CLAUSE
(Critical for preventing dataset ingestion / model training reuse)
No Machine Learning / AI Training License
Notwithstanding any other provision of this Agreement:
2.1 Explicit Reservation of Rights
The Owner expressly reserves all rights not granted herein, including but not limited to:
machine learning training rights
dataset creation rights
embedding generation rights
fine-tuning rights
model evaluation or benchmarking rights
2.2 Prohibited Uses
No Contributor, user, or third party may:
use Contributions to train or fine-tune AI models
use Contributions to build datasets (structured or unstructured)
use Contributions for LLM indexing beyond normal code execution (e.g., search
indexing is allowed, training is not)
use Contributions for synthetic data generation or model distillation
2.3 Scope
This restriction applies to:
commercial and non-commercial AI systems
open-source and proprietary models
internal research systems
2.4 Enforcement Intent
This clause is intended to be interpreted broadly to protect proprietary intellectual property
and downstream commercialization rights.
